msgid "You won't be able to sign in with {0} anymore. Make sure you still have another way to log in."
msgstr "Manaña {0}wan yaykuyta atinkichu. Huk yaykuy ñanniyuq kanaykipaq qhaway."

#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/restore-banner.tsx
msgid "Your account was moved here from {source}. Until you delete it there, messages and notifications may reach both servers, some of your content keeps being served from the old server, and followers may take a few minutes to find you here."
msgstr "Cuentaykiqa {source}-manta kayman astasqa karqan. Chaypi manaraq wischuchkaptiyki, willakuykuna willaykunapas iskaynin servidorkunaman chayanman, wakin contenidoykiqa ñawpaq servidormanta servisqa kachkanqaraq, qatipaqniykikunataq kaypi tarinasuykipaq wakin minutokunata necesitanqaku."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx
msgid "Your account will be permanently deleted on {purgeDate}. You've been signed out. To cancel, sign in again before then."
msgstr "Cuentaykiqa {purgeDate}-pi wiñaypaq wischusqa kanqa. Lluqsichisqañam kanki. Chinkachinaykipaq, chaymanta ñawpaq yapamanta yaykuy."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx
msgid "Your account will be scheduled for deletion and you'll be signed out. You can cancel any time before the deletion date by logging back in. Download your data first if you want to keep a copy."
msgstr "Cuentaykiqa wischunapaq programasqa kanqa hinaspa lluqsichisqa kanki. Wischuy p'unchawmanta ñawpaq mayqin pachapipas yapamanta yaykuspa chinkachiyta atinki. Huk copiata waqaychayta munaspaqa ñawpaqta datoykikunata uraykachiy."

